Flappy Bird Game – Unity Project
 

This is a simple Flappy Bird clone made using Unity.  
It includes flying bird mechanics, pipe spawning, scoring, and parallax background.

Project Structure

- `Assets/` - Contains game scripts, sprites, scenes, and prefabs
- `Scripts/` - Player, GameManager, Pipes, Parallax, and Spawner scripts
- `Scenes/` - Main game scene
- `Prefabs/` - Pipe prefab and other reusable objects

Features

- Player controls the bird by tapping to fly
- Pipes spawn automatically at intervals
- Parallax background scrolling
- Game over and reset functionality
- Basic UI for "Get Ready" and "Game Over"

Requirements

- Unity 2022 or later
- C# knowledge basics
- Git (optional, for version control)

How to Play

1. Open the project in Unity
2. Load the `flappy bird` scene
3. Press Play and start flying!
4. Avoid the pipes to survive and score points

Credits

Tutorial followed from [Zigurous YouTube Channel](https://www.youtube.com/@Zigurous)  
Project recreated and modified for learning purposes.

